<!DOCTYPE html><html><head runat="server"><title>Manage Progress</title></head><body><form id="form1" runat="server"><h2>Record Workout Progress</h2><a href="ManageActivity.aspx">Activities</a> | <a href="ManageGoal.aspx">Goals</a><p>Activity:<br /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlActivity" runat="server" AutoPostBack="true" OnSelectedIndexChanged="ddlActivity_SelectedIndexChanged" /></p><p>Metric records are stored as calories calculated from the 3 entered values.</p><p>Value 1:<asp:TextBox ID="txtValue1" runat="server" /> Value 2:<asp:TextBox ID="txtValue2" runat="server" /> Value 3:<asp:TextBox ID="txtValue3" runat="server" /></p><asp:Button ID="btnRecord" runat="server" Text="Calculate and Record" OnClick="btnRecord_Click" /><br /><asp:Label ID="lblMessage" runat="server" ForeColor="Red" /><h3>Total Calories: <asp:Label ID="lblTotal" runat="server" /></h3><asp:GridView ID="gvProgress" runat="server" /></form></body></html>
